asted purchases. For product 1 at 1.1, my estimate is about 900 more in losses than at 1.0.\n- **Factor 0.92** (candidate 3): shortages build up, and each missing unit of product 0 costs 11 (4 lost margin plus 7 penalty).\n- **Factor 1.0** (candidate 7): my estimate gives the lowest total loss for both products. Candidate 3 comes second.\n\nThe storage limit of 284 units doesn't come into play for the daily plans."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3941, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3941}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-27T09:54:16.533Z", "request_id": "req_011CgSY8XBCYLeqVrwpN2FbU"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01Biwf3BqDCL38MCz7LNEqJV", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgSY8XSKc93BVscgc1V6Q", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01Biwf3BqDCL38MCz7LNEqJV", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"choice": 7}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 3941, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2269, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 3941}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed"